### Kevalon ERP — Module 21: Fixed Assets Endpoints Reference
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@companyId = REPLACE_WITH_COMPANY_ID
@branchId = REPLACE_WITH_BRANCH_ID
@financialYearId = REPLACE_WITH_FINANCIAL_YEAR_ID
@assetId = REPLACE_WITH_ASSET_ID

### 1. Register a New Fixed Asset
# Creates a new asset and automatically registers Chart of Accounts ledger accounts
# if coaAssetAccountId, coaDepreciationExpenseAccountId, and coaAccumulatedDepreciationAccountId are omitted.
POST {{baseUrl}}/asset?companyId={{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "branchId": "{{branchId}}",
  "financialYearId": "{{financialYearId}}",
  "assetName": "MacBook Pro M3",
  "assetCode": "FA-2026-001",
  "purchaseDate": "2026-04-15",
  "purchaseCost": 150000,
  "salvageValue": 15000,
  "usefulLifeYears": 3,
  "depreciationMethod": "STRAIGHT_LINE",
  "depreciationRatePercent": 33.33,
  "notes": "Office laptops for development team"
}

### 2. List All Fixed Assets
GET {{baseUrl}}/asset?companyId={{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Get Asset Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/asset/{{assetId}}?companyId={{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Post Monthly Depreciation
# Calculates and updates the bookValue and creates a balanced Journal Entry
# (Debit Depreciation Expense, Credit Accumulated Depreciation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/asset/{{assetId}}/depreciation?companyId={{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "financialYearId": "{{financialYearId}}",
  "depreciationDate": "2026-05-31",
  "depreciationAmount": 12500,
  "remarks": "Monthly depreciation for May 2026"
}

### 5. Dispose of the Asset (Sale/Scrap/Write-Off)
# Sets the asset status to DISPOSED, bookValue to 0, calculates gain/loss,
# and posts a balanced Journal Entry reversing the cost/accumulated depreciation
# and recording gain/loss and proceeds.
POST {{baseUrl}}/asset/{{assetId}}/dispose?companyId={{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "financialYearId": "{{financialYearId}}",
  "disposalDate": "2026-08-15",
  "disposalType": "SALE",
  "saleProceeds": 135000,
  "remarks": "Asset sold due to upgrade"
}
